report : (,,) String ([] ((,) String ((,) String String))) String -> IO ()
report ((,,) name modules source) = putStrLn (name ++ "\t" ++ (case Compiler.compileModules (M.fromList compareString modules) (name ++ ".emlf") source of
  Left err -> "REJECT " ++ Compiler.prettyPhase (Compiler.phase err)
  Right result -> "ACCEPT " ++ Compiler.sourceType result))
main = L.mapM_ report fixtures
